Martin Seligman formulated

308
00:17:37,542 --> 00:17:40,280
the seminal paradigm of
Learned Helplessness.

309
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:42,376
In his classic experiments,

310
00:17:42,376 --> 00:17:45,384
when an animal was placed in
a chamber and subjected to

311
00:17:45,384 --> 00:17:48,446
unpredictable shocks from
which no evasion was possible,

312
00:17:48,446 --> 00:17:53,040
after repeated failed attempts to resist,
the creature ceased struggling altogether.

313
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:56,462
Even when researchers
subsequently opened the

314
00:17:56,462 --> 00:17:58,836
chamber door and removed
the electric current,

315
00:17:58,836 --> 00:18:00,435
