318
00:18:08,991 --> 00:18:10,560
“Any struggle is futile.”

319
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:15,415
Consider Gypsy’s developmental
reality: From her earliest memories,

320
00:18:15,415 --> 00:18:19,600
