the first two diagnostic markers:

432
00:24:52,180 --> 00:24:56,620
Red Flag One: Inexplicably Complex
History and Objective Contradictions.

433
00:24:57,500 --> 00:25:01,401
The dependent carries an extensive
roster of catastrophic diagnoses,

434
00:25:01,401 --> 00:25:05,188
yet objective laboratory and
radiological tests continually return

435
00:25:05,188 --> 00:25:08,860
