caregiver’s dramatic assertions.

436
00:25:09,840 --> 00:25:13,020
Red Flag Two: Situational
Emergence of Symptoms.

437
00:25:14,020 --> 00:25:16,714
The bizarre medical anomalies
manifest exclusively

438
00:25:16,714 --> 00:25:18,978
