446
00:25:41,120 --> 00:25:45,520
Red Flag Three: Doctor Shopping
and Attention Addiction.

447
00:25:46,220 --> 00:25:49,376
The caregiver routinely
engages in “Doctor shopping” –

448
00:25:49,376 --> 00:25:52,941
