451
00:26:01,940 --> 00:26:05,780
And Red Flag Four:
Enforced Social Seclusion.

452
00:26:06,620 --> 00:26:09,920
The victim is completely
severed from schooling, peers,

453
00:26:09,920 --> 00:26:14,840
and extended relatives under the benevolent
pretext of “shielding fragile health.”

454
00:26:16,100 --> 00:26:18,619
The caregiver fiercely
