456
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:28,451
[HOST] The dossier on the pink bungalow
in Springfield draws to a close,

457
00:26:28,451 --> 00:26:32,640
yet its inquiry into the nature of empathy
and human ethics echoes unresolved.

458
00:26:34,010 --> 00:26:38,104
Authentic parental devotion serves as
wings that empower a child to grow robust,

459
00:26:38,104 --> 00:26:41,380
