and freely explore the world.

460
00:26:42,380 --> 00:26:46,518
When maternal devotion is perverted
into an instrument of selfish ownership,

461
00:26:46,518 --> 00:26:48,859
when care transforms
into an agonizing cage

462
00:26:48,859 --> 00:26:51,201
feeding an adult’s
pathological ego... that

463
00:26:51,201 --> 00:26:55,720
